A||||50||theogre||Ogre's absence.||||9||
Z||000000||theogre||06-09-2000||06:36 PM||||I only have a few minutes on a computer at one of the nurses stations to write to you all. This will be brief because of that.<P>Some of you may have noticed I've been MIA for the last couple weeks. This is because I am stuck in the hospital without my computer.<P>To make a long story very short, What originally appeared to be a leg injury has been diagnosed as what I am told is a very treatable/cureable for of cancer.<P>I will be starting chemotherapy on monday acording to current plans. This will last around 12 weeks I'm told. (Joy 12+ weeks out of work.... Thank god for insurance.)<P>I'm stuck in hospital for at least another week. (I could use about a case of that Martini Fiero now. make that 2 cases.)<P>I don't know when I will have computer access again on any regular basis. (Yes, I'm going nuts with bordom.) I hope I can get my machine from home brought in tomorow. I can't take another whole week stuck here looking at the walls.<P>Once I get access again I'll likely be back on here just to get my mind off things, but I may not be a whole lot of use for the forseable future.<P>Obviuosly all the ogre cave update work is suspended. (((Cliff... Please read your info@ mailbox. Also please point the main cave links to the newer pages I sent you awhile back for testing. Those will have to do for now.))) I'm suppoosed to have some weeks where I'm less toxic than others, so maybe I'll work on it then if I'm not sleeping all the time. It'll give me something to do.<P>Right now I'm mostly achy and cranky from some surgery and blood clots in my leg. They tell me Chemo isn't as bad as it used to be. I guess I'll see next week. (Next week I get it every day.)<P>Well. that's all for now I guess. Those of you that pray please do so. I need all the help I can get.<p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 06-09-2000).]||||reg||9
