Z||000033||Frank R||06-11-2000||08:17 PM|||| Ogre. I pray for your speedy recovery.  I'm a prostate cancer survivor.  I'm cancer free now almost 3 years.  In my case no surgery only chemo and radiation.  The best medicine is to be occupied and make yourself have a winning attitude.  I'm 62 and survived.  Be strong and keep busy.   Where are you located?  We can fill some of your time with some funny cards.  Cards are good.  Where are you being treated?  And the address??<BR>Old guy in Idaho.......Frank R||||reg||7
