Z||000044||theogre||06-12-2000||08:25 PM||||well. the major agents they put me on are:<P>cisplatin<BR>etoposide<BR>bleomycin<P>plus assorted anti pukes and diuretics.<P>1 week every day<BR>then 2 weeks tues days only<BR>then repeat for a total of 12 weeks.<P>They tell me becuase It's a short program and the way it runs I shouldn't get bad anemic, but I'll still loose all the hair. If it comes out all shitty I'll just buzz it as soon as it starts.<P>today went ok. the hardest part to take was ramming in over a litre of D5 and normal saline in 4 hours. talk about bloating.||||reg||1
