Z||000050||NDFieroTN||06-16-2000||11:05 PM||||Ogre,<P>My wife has had chemo numerous times to try and control her lupus...All it did was made her meaner...Just kidding...Actually it has helped her alot...The worst part is the nausea and associated weakness...Someone get the license plate number off that truck...I<BR>think you'll understand what I mean...Anyway keep up with the nausea medicines...I work in the medical field and it will help if you take them as scheduled instead of waiting until you feel nauseated to take them...The bad part of them is they also make you tired and groggy...<P>Anyway...Just remember that you'll soon feel like the iron duke instead of the iron puke...<P>God Bless...||||reg||6
